cff-version: 1.2.0
title: yindle
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: vindeckyy
abstract: >-
  A memory-safe, drop-in replacement for the CUPS print spooler and
  scheduler (cupsd) written in Rust. Implements the IPP wire protocol,
  /etc/cups configuration, spool layout, and filter/backend process
  contract so existing print clients and drivers work unmodified.
keywords:
  - printing
  - cups
  - ipp
  - print spooler
  - rust
license: Apache-2.0 OR MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/vindeckyy/yindle
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-11-13"
